rgin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E4%BA%BA%E5%8A%9B%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%A8%88%E7%95%AB.jpg\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; vertical-align: middle; width: 800px; height: 601px;\\\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">「機水電配置與規劃」課程上課情形。圖／發展署提供</span></p>\n\n<hr style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\" />\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">依據勞動部統計，我國勞工依賴其受僱企業辦訓比率高達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">70.9</span>％，顯見企業辦訓與否，影響勞工甚鉅，但是企業辦訓比率卻只有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">35</span>％。為協助企業建構訓練體系，勞動部勞動力發展署推動「企業人力資源提升計畫」，補助部分訓練費用，協助企業提升人力素質。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">109</span>年度「企業人力資源提升計畫」將自今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>日起至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">12</span>月<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">31</span>日開放受理申請。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">發展署表示，企業可依其營運策略或發展方向規劃辦理員工訓練計畫，並向發展署所屬分署申請「企業人力資源提升計畫」，由政府補助其訓練費用；其中對於企業自行辦訓部分，補助講師鐘點費、交通費及場地費等；如企業指派員工參加外部訓練單位訓練課程，則補助<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">50</span>％至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">70</span>％的訓練費用。個別企業申請辦訓，訓練費用最高補助<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">95</span>萬元，若企業結合其他事業單位辦理訓練，則最高補助<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">190</span>萬元，又如企業屬經濟部「推動中堅企業躍升計畫」，或勞動部遴選的「國家人才發展獎」等獲獎單位，則最高補助<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">200</span>萬元。</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">發展署說明，「企業人力資源提升計畫」每年共補助約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1,000</span>家事業單位，並辦理約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>萬<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">6,000</span>門課程，培訓約<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10</span>萬名在職勞工，激勵企業持續提升員工專業知能與技術。以生產家電產品聞名的台灣松下電器公司，即透過「企業人力資源提升計畫」的挹注，在面臨人才高齡化危機時，改以高階主管能力養成為重點培訓，成功培育<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">40</span>多名主管級幹部，幫助公司成功避免出現人才斷層及缺口的窘境，在面臨產業變化時能以更具彈性的訓練方式迎接挑戰。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">(</span>工商<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\"><span>&nbsp;</span>)</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">https://www.chinatimes.com/realtimenews/20191127002803-260410?chdtv</span></p>\n\n<p style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2019-12-02","clk_count":"255"}},"__N_SSG":true}